  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REPSSI - Achieving better SRHR outcomes (2024-2026)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">REPSSI - Achieving better SRHR outcomes (2024-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad tillg&#xe5;ng till SRHR-information och tj&#xe4;nster f&#xf6;r utsatta och marginaliserade pojkar, flickor och ungdomar i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra Afrika f&#xf6;r b&#xe4;ttre SRHR-resultat.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved access to SRHR information and services for vulnerable and marginalized boys, girls and youth in East and Southern Africa for better SRHR outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is that adolescents enjoy good mental health, and can access information and services that enhance their sexual and reproductive health and rights. This will be reached through the following three objectives:

1. Strengthen capacity of community support structures, in the identification, management and referral of adolescents in need of psychosocial support and SRHR services.

2. Enhance the capacity of the health service workforce at selected health facilities, to integrate mental health and psychosocial support into SRHR services for adolescents.

3. Advocate for the integration of MHPSS and SRHR in relevant regional and national policy and legal frameworks to enhance their responsiveness to the MHPSS and SRHR needs of adolescents.</narrative>
  </description>
